[
  {
    "id": 2006004010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサー！　\r\nフフ、今日も一日お疲れ様",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……？\r\nお疲れ様……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの素晴らしいプロデュースのおかげで\r\n私はアイドルとして胸を張っていられる",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつも感謝しているよ\r\n改めてありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お礼を言ってもらえるのは嬉しいけど……\r\nいきなりどうしたんだ？　今日は随分とご機嫌みたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "わかるかい！？\r\nさすが、私のプロデューサーだ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それだけ嬉しそうなら誰でもわかると思うけど……\r\nそれで、いったい何があったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\n実は今日、下校する際に声をかけられてね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "初めて話す下級生の女の子だったんだけど、\r\n話がとても盛り上がったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことがあったのか\r\n良かったじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつもは見ているだけだったそうなんだが\r\n今日、思い切って声をかけてくれたらしい",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドルとして活動している私と、話をしてみたかった……\r\nそう、頬を可愛らしく染めてね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の載っている雑誌もチェックしてくれていて……\r\nファンだと言われてしまったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、嬉しいことだけど、少し照れてしまうね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……\r\n良かったな、咲耶！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、アイドルになって活動の場が増えたからかな\r\n以前より、ファンだと言ってくれる子が増えたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これもアイドルにならなかったら、\r\n生まれることのなかったかもしれない人との繋がりだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、全て私をアイドルにしてくれた\r\nプロデューサーのおかげだね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当に、ありがとう。プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶が頑張ってるからこそさ\r\nそれに、学生生活も充実してるようで何よりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドル活動も学生生活もそれぞれの楽しさがある\r\nこれからも、両立させていきたいな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そういえば……プロデューサーは\r\nどんな学生だったんだい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は普通だよ\r\n咲耶みたいな人気者ってわけでもなかったし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私だって人気というわけではないさ\r\n嬉しいことに、声をかけてくれる友人は多いけれどね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日のように、嬉しい出会いもあるからね\r\n色々な場所に行って、友人の輪を広げるようにしてるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだ、プロデューサーには、\r\n学校でのお気に入りの場所はあったかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今後の参考に、聞かせてほしいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010200"
  },
  {
    "select": "図書室だったかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "自分の教室だな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "裏庭だったな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010210,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "図書室かあ。フフ、私もよく行っているよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "読書はもちろんだが……友人と一緒に勉強したり\r\n好きな本の情報を交換したり……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本の好みというのはとても興味深いね\r\nその人本来の考え方というのが見える気がするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n俺は本を読んでばかりで、そんな発想はなかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら今度、\r\nプロデューサーの好きな本も教えてほしいな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nその時は咲耶のおすすめも教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、良いじゃないか\r\n楽しみにしているよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "好きな本を教えあって、お互いに感想を言いあう\r\n実に素敵なことだと思わないかい？　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010270,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "確かに、慣れ親しんだ場所が一番落ち着くね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "同じ空間で、同じ顔触れで……\r\nなのにそこでは、毎日違う出来事が起こる",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\n本当に楽しくて、飽きることを知らないよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶と同じクラスなんて、毎日楽しそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうかな？\r\n私は、アナタがクラスにいたらとても楽しいと思うんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、もし私とアナタが同じクラスで、\r\n隣の席だったりしたら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の毎日は、どんなものになっていただろうね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010320"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010330,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "裏庭か……！\r\nそれは盲点だったよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ、普通はあまり行かないよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね……\r\nつい、人の多そうなところに足を運んでしまうから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、今度行ってみようかと思うよ\r\nアナタの好きな場所だったのなら、特にね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010360,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これまでとはまた違う出会いの予感がするし……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004010370,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……フフ、もしかしたら、\r\nアナタのような面白い人に、出会えるかもしれないしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600401/2006004010370"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]